# Ordered profile registry, read by both switch.sh and waybar's profiles.py.
# One per line:  <dirname>|<label>|<active-glyph>|<idle-glyph>
#
# Order here == left-to-right order of the waybar profiles module.
#
# The indicators are deliberately uniform rather than one shape per profile:
# ten different glyphs in a row reads as clutter, and only U+25CF/U+25CB are
# covered across every font stack these themes use (FreeSerif is pinned as a
# last-resort fallback in each waybar.css, so no theme can render tofu).
# Identity comes from position and tooltip; state comes from fill and colour.
